OL,3,GNEWSAScottish police to target sadistic
OL,4,Aonline gangs forcing children to
OL,5,Aself-harm
OL,6,
OL,7,FDetectives in Scotland have joined
OL,8,Finternational law enforcement in
OL,9,Ftargeting online gangs which groom and
OL,10,Fcoerce children into acts of self-harm.
OL,12,FOfficers are hunting members of loose
OL,13,Fonline networks of sadists known as
OL,14,F"The Com", which mainly targets girls
OL,15,Fon gaming platforms and social media.
OL,17,FThe groups, mostly comprised of teenage
OL,18,Fand young adult males, have risen in
OL,19,Fprominence in recent years after cases
OL,20,Finvolving sextortion and hacking, as
OL,21,Fwell as self-harm encouragement.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
